title The Office Is Not Optional
date 2023-03-22
canonicalUrl https://www.businessinsider.com/elon-musk-emailed-twitter-staff-office-is-not-optional-2023-3

post-header.scroll

Sent to Twitter employees at about 2:30 a.m. on March 22, 2023, after Musk noticed the San Francisco office was half empty. The full email was not published; reporters who saw it quoted these lines.

quote
 The office is not optional.

quote
 The office in San Francisco was half empty yesterday.

Read the report from Business Insider.
